    "type": "game",
    "name": "Armada: Last Light",
    "steam_appid": 3319270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319270/extras/4f140f3dc28b439fbba7fe753af351ac.poster.avif?t=1744390444\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319270/extras/4f140f3dc28b439fbba7fe753af351ac.webm?t=1744390444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319270/extras/4f140f3dc28b439fbba7fe753af351ac.mp4?t=1744390444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in strategic battles with hundreds of ships using simple commands and tactical deployments. Carefully plan your attacks to preserve your fleet\u2019s strength as you prepare for the ultimate confrontation against the enemy Leviathan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fleet Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your fleet and unlock its full potential by liberating planets. With each victory, you\u2019ll gain a chance to acquire new ship blueprints or tech upgrades, allowing you to customize your fleet to overcome increasingly difficult enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tech Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your fleet with powerful tech upgrades that dramatically enhance your ships\u2019 capabilities. Discover new tools and enhancements to outmaneuver and outgun your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a galaxy that evolves with every run. Each playthrough introduces unique galaxies filled with diverse challenges, opportunities, and dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you liberate a galaxy, you unlock higher tiers of difficulty and earn a new ship to permanently add to your collection. Future games start with these ships in your fleet. The higher the tier of the galaxy you liberate, the more powerful the ship you receive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319270/extras/4f140f3dc28b439fbba7fe753af351ac.poster.avif?t=1744390444\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319270/extras/4f140f3dc28b439fbba7fe753af351ac.webm?t=1744390444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319270/extras/4f140f3dc28b439fbba7fe753af351ac.mp4?t=1744390444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in strategic battles with hundreds of ships using simple commands and tactical deployments. Carefully plan your attacks to preserve your fleet\u2019s strength as you prepare for the ultimate confrontation against the enemy Leviathan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fleet Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your fleet and unlock its full potential by liberating planets. With each victory, you\u2019ll gain a chance to acquire new ship blueprints or tech upgrades, allowing you to customize your fleet to overcome increasingly difficult enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tech Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your fleet with powerful tech upgrades that dramatically enhance your ships\u2019 capabilities. Discover new tools and enhancements to outmaneuver and outgun your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a galaxy that evolves with every run. Each playthrough introduces unique galaxies filled with diverse challenges, opportunities, and dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you liberate a galaxy, you unlock higher tiers of difficulty and earn a new ship to permanently add to your collection. Future games start with these ships in your fleet. The higher the tier of the galaxy you liberate, the more powerful the ship you receive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Command a fleet of customizable ships in this roguelite strategy autobattler. Liberate planets to unlock new ships and powerful upgrades. Engage in strategic battles, manage your fleet, and face escalating challenges as you fight to free the universe through increasingly difficult galaxies.",
